pub const VERSION: &str = "2026.11.08 (2)";

pub const SYNOPSIS: &str = "This version brings the owner's chosen look (Direction A, \"River\") to the template that builds the family's trip pages. A new trip page opens with its title and dates on paper beside the photo, with one water line under the title from the family's name, 洪. Headings come in four sizes that differ at a glance, in the site's two typefaces. Where we stay and Can't-miss show the words under each photo, at most four to a row, and Can't-miss now runs one row per day in date order. Labels are plain words, nothing floats in as you scroll, and a day's photo sits above its words. The template's notes now set the family's plain voice, and its page check refuses pet words and \"it's not X, it's Y\" lines. Trip pages already on the site are unchanged until a new version is uploaded.";
